issions that pay once still open per pilot (the tool fleet, view=capacity), what each chain's ask carries, what each gap loads. A one-load gap is flown once by hand (errors.log ENT-027); a draft never lies in the clone (ENT-029). Owed to you by me: the empty-hold check by value, `requires.booked`, the craft step.
